scholar-search
==============

Version: 0.3.14 (2026-10-21)

Academic search: a read-only, microkernel-based scholarly metadata service.

This project is an independent, non-official tool. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by any academic database operator.

Third-party references
----------------------

Channel selectors and interaction flows were informed by the public project
cookjohn/cnki-skills (MIT License), which documents CNKI page structure and
search flows. No source code from that project is copied; only factual
selector knowledge and workflow order are referenced.

  https://github.com/cookjohn/cnki-skills

Trademarks
----------

"CNKI", "知网", and other names are trademarks of their respective owners.
They are used here only to describe interoperability targets, not as branding.

Data
----

No bibliographic data, credentials, cookies, or session material is
distributed with this project. Test fixtures are recorded page structure with
personal and session data removed.













